#: ../src/cli/abrtcli/cli/status.py:40
msgid "ABRT has detected a problem. For more information, run “abrt list{}”"
msgstr ""
"ABRT telah mendeteksi masalah. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, jalankan \"abrt "
"list{}\""

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_CCpp.xml.in.h:1
msgid ""
"Send core dump to remote retrace server for analysis or perform local "
"analysis if the remote analysis fails"
msgstr ""
"Kirim core dump ke server retrace jarak jauh untuk analisis atau lakukan "
"analisis lokal jika analisis jarak jauh gagal"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_CCpp.xml.in.h:2
msgid ""
"Uploads coredump to a server, which generates backtrace and returns it. If "
"user doesn't want to upload his coredump to anywhere the event performs "
"local analysis. Local analysis is run event if remote analysis fails. Pros: "
"no need for debuginfo downloads. Retrace server's database of debuginfos is "
"more complete. Retrace server may generate better backtraces. Cons: coredump "
"you upload contains all the data from the crashed program, including your "
"private data, if any."
msgstr ""
"Mengunggah coredump ke server, yang menghasilkan backtrace dan "
"mengembalikannya. Jika pengguna tidak ingin mengunggah coredumpnya ke mana "
"pun, event melakukan analisis lokal. Analisis lokal dijalankan jika analisis "
"jarak jauh gagal. Kelebihan: tidak perlu unduhan debuginfo. Database "
"debuginfo server retrace lebih lengkap. Server retrace dapat menghasilkan "
"backtrace yang lebih baik. Kekurangan: coredump yang Anda unggah berisi "
"semua data dari program yang crash, termasuk data pribadi Anda, jika ada."

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_VMcore.xml.in.h:1
msgid "Analyze VM core"
msgstr "Analisis core VM"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_VMcore.xml.in.h:2
msgid "Install kernel debuginfo packages, generate kernel log and oops message"
msgstr "Instal paket debuginfo kernel, hasilkan log kernel dan pesan oops"

#: ../src/plugins/analyze_VMcore.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
"Needs to install kernel debuginfo packages, which might take significant "
"time, and take up disk space."
msgstr ""
"Perlu menginstal paket debuginfo kernel, yang mungkin memakan waktu cukup "
"lama, dan memakan ruang disk."

#: ../src/plugins/collect_GConf.xml.in.h:1
msgid "Collect GConf configuration"
msgstr "Kumpulkan konfigurasi GConf"

#: ../src/plugins/collect_GConf.xml.in.h:2
msgid "Save configuration from application's GConf directory"
msgstr "Simpan konfigurasi dari direktori GConf aplikasi"

#: ../src/plugins/collect_GConf.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
"Runs gconftool-2 --recursive-list /apps/executable and saves it as "
"'gconf_subtree' element."
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan gconftool-2 --recursive-list /apps/executable dan menyimpannya "
"sebagai elemen 'gconf_subtree'."

#: ../src/plugins/collect_vimrc_system.xml.in.h:1
msgid "Collect system-wide vim configuration files"
msgstr "Kumpulkan file konfigurasi vim seluruh sistem"

#: ../src/plugins/collect_vimrc_system.xml.in.h:2
msgid "Save /etc/vimrc and /etc/gvimrc"
msgstr "Simpan /etc/vimrc dan /etc/gvimrc"

#: ../src/plugins/collect_vimrc_system.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
"Checks if there are vimrc and gvimrc files in /etc and saves them as "
"system_vimrc and system_gvimrc, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa apakah ada file vimrc dan gvimrc di /etc dan menyimpannya sebagai "
"system_vimrc dan system_gvimrc."

#: ../src/plugins/collect_vimrc_user.xml.in.h:1
msgid "Collect yours vim configuration files"
msgstr "Kumpulkan file konfigurasi vim Anda"

